pplication Functions:\r\nadding files to view in the application directory;\r\ndeleting files;\r\nrenaming files;\r\nzoom in on the page for easy reading;\r\nquick navigation by page number;\r\nability to send comics from the application to messengers and social networks;\r\nbookmark pages to remember an interesting moment;\r\nprompt feedback on problems that arise during the use of the application.\r\n\r\nDownload Comics Reader for free right now and enjoy reading your favorite graphic novels or comics with your favorite super heroes. Also in your developer account, you will find a lot of tools for reading and managing documents on your device: PDF Reader, DjVu Reader, PDF to Video converter, PDF to Image converter, and universal readers of all formats.\r\n\r\nIn the application, you can disable advertising for a nominal fee; thereby, you will help to maintain the work of the reader and make reading even more comfortable. Manage files in cbr, cbz, jpeg, png, cb7, cbt, and gif on your device, and Reader will help you plunge into the fantastic world of comics!\r\nIf you have any problems using the application or have suggestions for improving Comic Reader, then you can write to us by email at support@android-tools.ru. We will be glad to receive your feedback.",
